./paper/parts/part04_geometry_retarded_mouth.tex:17:The endpoint is again a reduced obstruction packet, not a finished nonlinear branch.  The remaining \(2.5\)PN ambiguity collapses to the outgoing normalization factor \(\chi_Q\); outlet and core models isolate the viable compensated branch; mouth-source and co-evolving corrections then compress the last first-order obstruction to one microscopic normal coordinate.
