    36	\]
    37	
    38	## Canonical invariant coefficients
    39	
    40	With \(N_Q=1\), the canonical invariant low-frequency quadrupole coefficients are fixed to their target values:
    41	\[
    42	\boxed{
    43	\overline K_0=\frac{54Gc_s^5}{5a^5c^5},
    44	\qquad
    45	\overline K_2=\frac{6Gc_s^3}{5a^3c^5},
    46	\qquad
